    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The lower part of your face takes terrible damage, burning away your lips, damaging your cheek muscles and scorching your tongue.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> This counts as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.hCadFsTRvLN9faaY]{Broken Bone (Major)} as the muscles controlling your lower jaw and tongue try to recover from the broiling. Also, you suffer a permanent penalty of -20 to your Fellowship whenever your disfigured lipless mouth is visible.</p>"
